                "text": "House Republicans tried to hide cuts to SNAP in the \"Miscellaneous\" section of the Farm Bill.\n\nNutrition is not \"miscellaneous.\" It should be a priority in this country.\n\nHunger is a policy choice. I hope my Republican colleagues will reconsider their cuts to SNAP. https://t.co/1x45prVPvi",
